### 10.2.2 `register-restore` algorithm and failure ordering\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1376:#### 10.2.3 Cross-runtime continuation transport and layout compatibility\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1380:travel across `yin.vm.engine.host.v1` as checked task-local capability\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1397:#### 10.2.4 Register wait-entry validation scope\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1410:### 10.3 Register module attachment, `spawn-module`, and artifact cache\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1418:embedding API, outside an active `yin.vm.engine.host.v1` `exchange` after\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1434:`yin.vm.engine.host.v1` ABI/emitter version, and feature profile; `R` alone is\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1438:### 10.4 Register conformance fixture schema (K0/W0)\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1472:### 10.5 Register-specific W0–W6 implementation slices and acceptance gates\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1477:`yin.vm.engine.host.v1` transport gates (`COMPLETE→NEED_SPACE→fetch-response`,\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1482:#### 10.5.1 W0 — Register admission, codec, and eight-field synchronization gates\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1498:#### 10.5.2 W1 — Pure register execution and body dispatch\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1525:#### 10.5.3 W2 — Continuations and `register-restore`\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1552:#### 10.5.4 W3 — Streams, shared scheduler, and FFI\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1593:W3 also forces `NEED_SPACE` after real effectful transitions: stream append,\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1602:#### 10.5.5 W4 — Attach, modules, and lifetime correctness\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1641:#### 10.5.6 W5 — Lane completion and release gate\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1645:`yin.vm.engine.host.v1` ABI versioning and deterministic binary generation. Run\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1662:final-value checks. Verify byte-identical artifacts, `yin.vm.engine.host.v1`\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1663:import allowlist, malformed ABI/overflow/`NEED_SPACE`/repeated-fetch handling,\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1670:#### 10.5.7 W6 — Measured optimization and register non-goals\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1674:arena/heap retention, dispatch cost, serialized `yin.vm.engine.host.v1` message\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1687:engine; the `i32`-handle `yin.vm.engine.host.v1` ABI and full kit remain the\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1700:#### 10.5.8 Rust K1–K5 and LLVM acceptance retained\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1715:### 10.6 Register-specific risks, reference conventions, and open items\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1737:single-port transition boundary under `yin.vm.engine.host.v1`, and the W0\ndocs/design/yin.vm.debruijn.register.md:1738:`COMPLETE→NEED_SPACE→fetch-response` transport-test notation).\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
